n novel drying process improvement technology.Capture a healthy share of the manufacturing market.Generate and maintain new U.S. jobs.Assure a strong U.S. economy and standard of living.","url":"/centers/center-for-advanced-research-in-drying/","image":"/assets/images/twittercard.png","siteName":null,"type":"article"},"resilience":{"checks":[{"id":"pwa-https","label":"HTTPS (required for service workers)","status":"pass","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://iucrc.nsf.gov/centers/center-for-advanced-research-in-drying/","why":"HTTPS is required for service workers and most install prompts."},{"id":"pwa-manifest","label":"Web app manifest declared","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://iucrc.nsf.gov/centers/center-for-advanced-research-in-drying/","why":"A web app manifest is required for installability and controls how the app appears when launched."},{"id":"pwa-service-worker","label":"Service worker registered","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://iucrc.nsf.gov/centers/center-for-advanced-research-in-drying/","why":"A service worker is what makes offline access, caching, and background sync possible."},{"id":"pwa-theme-color","label":"Theme color declared","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://iucrc.nsf.gov/centers/center-for-advanced-research-in-drying/","why":"Theme color controls the browser chrome/status-bar color when the site is installed or bookmarked."},{"id":"pwa-apple-touch-icon","label":"Apple touch icon (iOS/bookmark icon)","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://iucrc.nsf.gov/centers/center-for-advanced-research-in-drying/","why":"iOS uses this icon for home-screen bookmarks and \"Add to Home Screen\" — without it the icon falls back to a screenshot."},{"id":"manifest-parsed","label":"Manifest fetched and parsed successfully","status":"n/a","evidence":"No manifest declared","exampleUrl":"https://iucrc.nsf.gov/centers/center-for-advanced-research-in-drying/","why":"A manifest that fails to parse cann